{"id":"fc88f329ff785b03","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-high-function-enumeration.md","title":"High 与全可计算函数统一枚举","display":"thm-high-function-enumeration — High 与全可计算函数统一枚举","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-high-function-enumeration","aliases":["20-thm-high-function-enumeration"],"display":"thm-high-function-enumeration — High 与全可计算函数统一枚举","chapter":"4","section":"4.8.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.8.2(i)–(iii)","source_printed_pages":[100,101],"source_pdf_pages":[136,137],"depends_on":["[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]","[[20-thm-martin-high]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-high-function-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-high-function-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-high-function-enumeration — High 与全可计算函数统一枚举"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.8.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.8.2(i)–(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>100</span><span>101</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>136</span><span>137</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7f202b538b169b2\" href=\"?note=c7f202b538b169b2\" title=\"20-thm-martin-high\">20-thm-martin-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TotComp}=\\{\\varphi_e:\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{TotComp}=\\{\\varphi_e:\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\omega\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7f202b538b169b2\" href=\"?note=c7f202b538b169b2\" title=\"20-thm-martin-high\">20-thm-martin-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}high-function-enumeration}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\le_T A&#39;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Uniform}_A(\\mathsf{TotComp})\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Subuniform}_A(\\mathsf{TotComp}).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}high-function-enumeration}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\le_T A&#39;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Uniform}_A(\\mathsf{TotComp})\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Subuniform}_A(\\mathsf{TotComp}).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 Martin 定理取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算支配函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle e,i\\rangle\">\\(\\langle e,i\\rangle\\)</span> 行在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，检查所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\le x\">\\(z\\le x\\)</span> 是否在时限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+g(z)\">\\(i+g(z)\\)</span> 内停止；若是输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(x)\">\\(\\varphi_e(x)\\)</span>，否则输出 0。总程序行在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 上完全正确；其余行一旦首次检查失败，此后恒为 0，因而每行仍是普通可计算函数。反向，从子统一矩阵取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x)=1+\\max_{e\\le x}f(x,e)\">\\(h(x)=1+\\max_{e\\le x}f(x,e)\\)</span>，它最终支配每个普通可计算函数，再用 Martin 定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.8.2(i)–(iii)；印刷页 100, 101；PDF 第 136, 137 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"8756810b413a47d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-martin-high","status":"resolved","id":"c7f202b538b169b2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-martin-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"8756810b413a47d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-martin-high","status":"resolved","id":"c7f202b538b169b2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TotComp}=\\{\\varphi_e:\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}high-function-enumeration}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\varnothing''\\le_T A'\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Uniform}_A(\\mathsf{TotComp})\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Subuniform}_A(\\mathsf{TotComp}).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle e,i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"z\\le x","display":false},{"tex":"i+g(z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(x)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"h(x)=1+\\max_{e\\le x}f(x,e)","display":false}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[{"id":"d83faf50f3b30d4d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；see [[20-thm-high-function-enumeration]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]；see [[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]。"},{"id":"47dda3af2234de34","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-high-function-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-high-function-enumeration]] — 章 4；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-high-function-enumeration]]"}],"outgoing":["8756810b413a47d8","c7f202b538b169b2","4ef1aee16db6b308"]}